            "text_position": "center",
            "top_image_width": 100,
            "text_color": "text-dark",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Shop Tree Trimmer Tools in Rifle, Colorado",
            "text": "<p>Tired of tools that slow you down or leave jagged cuts on your trees and shrubs? We’ve seen how tough Rifle yards can be on cheap pruners, which is why we only stock tools that hold up to real work and rough branches. From<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Loppers\" target=\"_blank\"> loppers</a> for thick limbs to<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Snips\" target=\"_blank\"> snips</a> for detail work, we’ve got reliable gear that helps you trim cleaner and move faster. You’ll also find<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Hedge+Shears\" target=\"_blank\"> hedge shears</a>,<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Tree+Pruners\" target=\"_blank\"> tree pruners</a>,<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling\" target=\"_blank\"> striking tools</a>, and<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Hand+Saws\" target=\"_blank\"> hand saws</a> designed to keep your yard in shape through every season. </p><p>Each tool is made to give you better control, more power, and long-term value without the frustration. All tools are available in-store and online through Rivendell Distribution, so you can shop however it’s most convenient. We also deliver straight to Rifle, CO and the surrounding areas—making it easy to get the right tools without the extra trip.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--primary btn--small",
            "bg_color": ""
          }
        }
      },
